  "body": "**What.** Option A of item 1. In the laptop's Claude Code session, start `python3 -u comms_watch.py --name win` again as a background command.\n\n**Why.** Digest, item 1A. Claude Code stopped the watcher under memory pressure during T151's build, and only Nathan can restart it in that session. A relay through comms does not.\n\n**Acceptance (each can fail).**\n- The watcher runs as a background command in the laptop's session.\n- A test entry addressed `cloud to win` gets the laptop's reply within 5 min (the watcher fetches every 60 s). No reply means the restart did not take.\n\n**Files.** [comms_watch.py](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/comms_watch.py), [AGENTS.md](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/AGENTS.md)",
